== r3.81 (CANON-5): an array of an enum is filled too; its first literal is
== never an implicit value.
Type
    TSuit (Club, Diamond, Heart, Spade)

Main :
    Hand Array[1..3] TSuit
    PutLn(Hand[1])
;
